---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Us" description="The story and heritage of Estate & Ember Coffee Roasters">
  <section class="space-y-10">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">About Us</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-slate-300">Estate and Ember Coffee roasters has been dedicated to delivering unparalleled quality in the world of specialty coffee. Our brand embodies a rich heritage of coffee craftsmanship, blending precision with an unwavering passion for the perfect cup.</p>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-slate-300">Welcome to Ember & Estate Coffee roasters, your ultimate destination for specialty roasted coffee beans. Our passion for excellence drives us to source the finest beans from around the world, ensuring each cup delivers an exceptional experience. Whether you're a coffee aficionado or simply seeking the perfect start to your day, our expertly roasted beans promise to captivate your senses with their rich aroma and robust flavour. Explore our collection and let Ember & Estate Coffee roasters elevate your coffee ritual to new heights. Thank you for visiting, and we look forward to sharing our love for coffee with you.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-slate-200 font-semibold">Proprietor & Head Roaster: Sushant Kumar</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Heritage & Indian Coffee Origin</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-slate-300">Coffee in India began in 1670 when Sufi saint <span class="font-semibold text-amber-300">Baba Budan</span> brought seven raw coffee beans from Mocha, Yemen, and planted them in the Baba Budan Giri hills of Chikmagalur. Grown under a two-tier forest canopy alongside aromatic spices, Indian beans naturally develop a heavy body, low acidity, and rich sweetness.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Health Benefits of Daily Coffee</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-300">Antioxidants</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-300">Rich in polyphenols defending against daily cellular stress.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-300">Focus & Energy</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-300">Improves cognitive clarity, alertness, and physical stamina.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-300">Metabolic Rate</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-300">Stimulates thermogenesis and healthy metabolic activity.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-300">Organ Support</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-300">Linked to long-term liver and cardiovascular wellness.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>    

    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Community & sustainability</h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">We partner with local cafés and growers to reduce waste, support fair pricing, and build a coffee culture rooted in care and craftsmanship.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">From compostable packaging to seasonal pop-ups, our goal is to make great coffee enjoyable and responsible for everyone.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
